MORET_BEGIN
GODIVA arret SUPE
* Hypothese : H26 TERM KEFF SIGM 0.0001 SUPE 0.98 sur systeme surcritique (r = 9 cm) : arret des que keff - 3 sigma > 0.98 ; message specifique ?
* Attendu    : NORMAL END, arret anticipe, message d arret a determiner

GEOM
  MODU 0
    TYPE 1 SPHE 9.0
    VOLU 1 0 1 UMET 0. 0. 0.
  ENDM
ENDG

MATE
  CONT
    LIBR jeff311.xml
    TEMP 300
    COMP UMET
      CONC
        U234 4.91895E-04
        U235 4.49988E-02
        U238 2.49865E-03
    ENDC
  ENDM

SOUR
  UNIF 1000
ENDS

TERM
  CYCL PASS 30 ACTI 20
  KEFF SIGM 0.0001 SUPE 0.98
ENDT

ENDD
MORET_END
